    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This is a collection of lab assignments that don't fall into any other category.",
      "source_hash": 7673372710927861920,
      "context_hash": 14725684044384758503,
      "translation": "이곳은 다른 어떤 범주에도 속하지 않는 과제들을 모아 둔 실습 모음입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "assignments": "과제",
        "collection of lab": "실습 모음"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:25:46.107232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Also, here we could have generic excercises, i.e. benchmarks and workloads which suffer from multiple performance bottlenecks, for example binary search.",
      "source_hash": 13878416022402868886,
      "context_hash": 5865159600859831923,
      "translation": "또한 이곳에는 일반적인 연습 문제, 즉 이진 탐색처럼 여러 성능 병목을 동시에 겪는 벤치마크와 워크로드를 둘 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bottlenecks": "병목",
        "workloads": "워크로드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:16:47.700582Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Here are some ideas what could be covered here:",
      "source_hash": 4067298241639409718,
      "context_hash": 286803675493633046,
      "translation": "이곳에서 다룰 수 있는 아이디어는 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:16:47.700582Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Various data-driven transformations, e.g. [this](https://easyperf.net/blog/2019/11/22/data-driven-tuning-specialize-switch) or [this](https://easyperf.net/blog/2019/11/27/data-driven-tuning-specialize-indirect-call).",
      "source_hash": 18083473702994114331,
      "context_hash": 4385458299559922060,
      "translation": "다양한 데이터 기반 변환(예: [이것](https://easyperf.net/blog/2019/11/22/data-driven-tuning-specialize-switch) 또는 [이것](https://easyperf.net/blog/2019/11/27/data-driven-tuning-specialize-indirect-call)).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:16:47.700582Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[Cache warming](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XzRxikGgaHI).",
